WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Willy and Dolly: Everyone Brought Pie

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:27.000
John types: send the family tmrws list. keep it short

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.000
Dolly: Fewer words, or fewer things?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:36.000
John types: fewer things. its a big week. everyones tired

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:49.000
John types: thx

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.600
Willy, softly: That's the whole family.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:03.300
John types: send everyone tmrws list. big dinner

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:03.100
Dolly: Fewer words, or fewer things… again?

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:14.300
John types: neither. everyone is coming. like everyone

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.900
Willy: We're out of edges.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.900
Dolly: …Everyone brought pie.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:28.300
Willy, yelling: WE'RE SO LUCKY!

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.900
Willy, softly: That's us.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:51.200
John types: how many for dinner? ask the house

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.000
Willy: On it!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:59.200
Willy: Upstairs, three! Down the hall, two! Downstairs, four!

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:03.400
Dolly: Is that everyone?

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:10.400
John types: thats 9. plus me. plus u two

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.400
Willy, softly: We count.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:31.900
John types: going around the table. what r u thankful for

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:31.500
Willy, yelling: YOU!

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:51.300
Dolly: …All of you.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.300
Willy, yelling: THAT'S WHAT I SAID!

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:09.200
John types: leftovers. who wants what

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:18.000
Dolly: How much pie is left?

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:23.400
John types: one bite

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:46.300
Dolly: Thanks for watching “Everyone Brought Pie”!

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:46.500
Willy: Next time: “Just Ask”!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.700
Willy and Dolly. Episode 5: Everyone Brought Pie. Next: Just Ask. Talk to us: willyanddolly.com/talk.
